      "position": [
        25504,
        10944
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Untitled workflow\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Receives search commands via Telegram and parses configuration. 2. Generates a search plan and fetches postings from Adzuna and Remotive. 3. Deduplicates results against existing entries in Google Sheets. 4. Leverages Google Gemini AI to rank and score the best opportunities. 5. Sends reports back to the user via Telegram and logs results to sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure Telegram Bot credentials for the trigger and response nodes.\n- Set up Google Sheets OAuth2 and provide the spreadsheet ID for logging.\n- Configure Gemini API credentials for the LLM processing nodes.\n- Add valid API keys for job board integration services.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can modify the search domains, LLM prompt templates, or the destination spreadsheet columns to track specific job attributes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "98471407-aa30-4b68-9dcb-9ded8c8a5ae8",
